    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Accenture plc describes itself as embracing change to create 360-degree value and shared success for its clients, people, shareholders, partners, and communities. The company says it works across industries and around the world to create better experiences using emerging technologies and human ingenuity.\n\nIts website discusses AI topics including the Human + AI era, AI tokenomics, AI ROI, and enterprise AI economics. It also covers AI-driven power demand for data centers, cyber resilience, and a project to help the European Commission's Directorate-General for International Partnerships scale AI across global operations. The site text does not name specific AI products.\n\nAccenture plc is a public company traded under the ticker ACN, headquartered in Dublin, with SEC CIK 0001467373. It is also listed under the alias ACCENTURE PLC-CL A. No lawsuits are recorded in the available facts.",
